 "notes": [
  "Posted 12 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "The post has no starting section; the objective (posted under 'Have/Want') and Heading For The Medical Frigate are in the normal sections and count toward the 60. The strategy says 'You start with Keeping the empire out forever, Your insight serves you well and Squadron assignements', so three Effects start and none is set as the single starting Effect.",
  "The section headers (Places, Guys, Blue, Surprises, Stasis, Green, Formula, Have/Want) are the author's own names for locations, characters, vehicles/starships, interrupts, effects, weapon, podracer and objective.",
  "Posted 'Weapon Levitation' dested the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt; 'I'll Take The Leader - Admiral's Order' dested I'll Take The Leader; 'Run Luke, Run' dested Run Luke, Run!.",
  "The wiki also has the author's later deck 'Fabien Jacques Qiet mining colony v2 - BELGIAN STYLE'."
